WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.503
-Since our last "A Closer Look"
four days ago,

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:04.971
the president's
head of fund raising,

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.674
Kimberly Guilfoyle, who's also
Donald Trump Jr.'s girlfriend,

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:11.311
was accused of showing [bleep]
pics from romantic partners

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:14.481
and fans to an assistant
at Fox News,

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:17.150
and then the First Lady
was caught on tape

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:19.952
delivering a profanity-laced
tirade about migrant children

00:00:19.952 --> 00:00:21.921
and basically saying
[bleep] Christmas,

00:00:21.921 --> 00:00:23.355
and none of it mattered.

00:00:23.355 --> 00:00:26.992
We couldn't even have one day
enjoying those stories

00:00:26.992 --> 00:00:28.827
because immediately after that,
the president,

00:00:28.827 --> 00:00:31.231
a.k.a., the Grinch
who stole [bleep] Christmas,

00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:33.466
and a bunch of high-ranking
Republican officials

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:34.901
tested positive for coronavirus,

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:36.969
effectively hobbling
the US government,

00:00:36.969 --> 00:00:38.771
putting untold numbers
of people at risk.

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:40.940
And then on Sunday,
after several days

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:43.175
of brazen lying about the
situation from the White House,

00:00:43.175 --> 00:00:45.978
the president took a joyride
in his motorcade

00:00:45.978 --> 00:00:47.613
while he was still infectious,

00:00:47.613 --> 00:00:50.216
infuriating medical experts
and Secret Service agents.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:53.319
But, hey, at least
it's November, right?

00:00:53.319 --> 00:00:55.688
Oh. It's October.
October what?

00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:57.056
5th?!

00:00:57.056 --> 00:01:00.326
You mean, like,
the fifth week of October?

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:02.729
Five days?! Oh, boy.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:05.098
I better drink this Red Bull
to stay awake.

00:01:05.098 --> 00:01:06.098
I'm just kidding. I can't sleep.

00:01:06.098 --> 00:01:08.067
It's time for "A Closer Look."

00:01:08.067 --> 00:01:10.936 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:10.936 --> 00:01:13.239
We are seven months into
a pandemic that has killed

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:16.242
210,000 Americans and infected
more than 7 million.

00:01:16.242 --> 00:01:19.645
On Friday we recorded
over 50,000 new cases,

00:01:19.645 --> 00:01:20.780
the most since mid-August,

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:22.715
while only three states
saw declines,

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:26.586
and there were 30,000 Americans
hospitalized with COVID-19.

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.855
Among them, the president
of the United States.

00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:31.024
But don't worry,
the president reassured us all

00:01:31.024 --> 00:01:32.892
in a message from
his hospital suite

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:35.328
that this has been a very
educational experience for him.

00:01:35.328 --> 00:01:38.397
-We have enthusiasm like
probably nobody's ever had.

00:01:38.397 --> 00:01:41.000
Our people that love the job
we're doing,

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:44.304
we have more enthusiasm
than maybe anybody.

00:01:44.304 --> 00:01:47.807
So, it's been
a very interesting journey.

00:01:47.807 --> 00:01:49.609
I learned lot about COVID.

00:01:49.609 --> 00:01:51.944
I learned it
by really going to school.

00:01:51.944 --> 00:01:53.512
This is the real school.

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:55.781
This isn't the
"Let's read the book" school.

00:01:55.781 --> 00:01:58.251
And I get it.
And I understand it.

00:01:58.251 --> 00:02:00.753
-First of all,
"Let's read the book" school

00:02:00.753 --> 00:02:02.221
is just school.

00:02:02.221 --> 00:02:03.856
That's what school is.

00:02:03.856 --> 00:02:06.659
It's like calling it a
"Let's eat the food" restaurant

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:08.361
or "Let's do the exercise" gym.

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:10.763
Second, now you've learned
a lot about COVID?

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.565
Maybe you could have
looked into it a little bit

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:15.368
before you and 7 million
other Americans got it.

00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:17.036
You can learn to cross
the street safely

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:18.337
without getting hit
by a bus first.

00:02:18.337 --> 00:02:20.773
He's like dud in a full body
cast saying,

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:23.576
"Great news. I learned a lot
about 'Don't walk' signs."

00:02:23.576 --> 00:02:26.078
This is a deadly disease,
and you sound like a retiree

00:02:26.078 --> 00:02:28.814
posting Facebook photos from
your trip to the Caribbean.

00:02:28.814 --> 00:02:30.216
[ As Trump ] It's been
an interesting journey.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:33.919
We tried mahi-mahi and learned
how to dance the merengue.

00:02:33.919 --> 00:02:35.521
[ Normal voice ] If only
there was a way to learn about

00:02:35.521 --> 00:02:37.389
this deadly and highly
infectious disease

00:02:37.389 --> 00:02:38.558
without getting it.

00:02:38.558 --> 00:02:39.691
[ As Trump ] Fauci,
why didn't you tell me

00:02:39.691 --> 00:02:41.194
this thing was so bad?

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:43.262
Oh, you shouldn't touch
your face, Fauci.

00:02:43.262 --> 00:02:45.465
I learned that the only way
you can, by catching COVID.

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:47.432
I'm basically a doctor now.
We're colleagues, Fauci.

00:02:47.432 --> 00:02:48.467
You're my best friend.

00:02:48.467 --> 00:02:49.635
[ Normal voice ]
Also, what do you mean

00:02:49.635 --> 00:02:50.836
this is the real school?

00:02:50.836 --> 00:02:52.438
You sound like a divorced dad

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:54.473
taking his 12-year-old
to the OTB.

00:02:54.473 --> 00:02:55.608
[ Inhales sharply ]
[ Gruff voice ] All right.

00:02:55.608 --> 00:02:57.243
This isn't "Let's read the book"
school.

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:58.611
This is where you learn
about real life.

00:02:58.611 --> 00:02:59.511
Now, when you go in,
remember,

00:02:59.511 --> 00:03:01.547
bet it all on three legs.

00:03:01.547 --> 00:03:03.949
What's that? No, no, no,
Daddy can't come in.

00:03:03.949 --> 00:03:06.152
Yeah, yeah, it does have
to do with a picture

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.619
of my driver's license
on the back wall.

00:03:07.619 --> 00:03:09.021
Eh, it's hard to explain.

00:03:09.021 --> 00:03:11.023
You know that kite you fly
in the backyard?

00:03:11.023 --> 00:03:12.791
Well, Daddy did that
with some checks.

00:03:12.791 --> 00:03:14.127
[ Normal voice ]
And then shortly after that,

00:03:14.127 --> 00:03:16.795
Trump staged a shockingly
reckless photo op

00:03:16.795 --> 00:03:18.564
when he left the hospital
still infectious

00:03:18.564 --> 00:03:21.233
with a deadly virus and made
his security detail

00:03:21.233 --> 00:03:23.769
drive him past a throng
of supporters in his motorcade.

00:03:23.769 --> 00:03:26.672
Nothing projects strength
like waving from the back seat

00:03:26.672 --> 00:03:29.408
of an SUV like a kid
headed for soccer practice.

00:03:29.408 --> 00:03:32.278
Smart move keeping your
juice box between your knees.

00:03:32.278 --> 00:03:33.979
So when you said you learned
about COVID,

00:03:33.979 --> 00:03:35.781
did you mean you learned
how to spread it?

00:03:35.781 --> 00:03:38.985
Surprised he didn't jump out
of the SUV and crowd surf.

00:03:38.985 --> 00:03:41.754
Seriously, you're in an enclosed
space with other people.

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:43.923
What's next, are you going
to cough on the Girl Scouts

00:03:43.923 --> 00:03:46.325
who sold the most cookies
in a Walter Reed elevator?

00:03:46.325 --> 00:03:49.161
This image captures all
the heedless negligence

00:03:49.161 --> 00:03:51.730
and disregard for human life
that has characterized

00:03:51.730 --> 00:03:54.133
the Trump administration and its
response to the pandemic.

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:56.169
He exposed Secret Service
agents, among others,

00:03:56.169 --> 00:03:58.303
to a deadly virus
just for a quick ego boost.

00:03:58.303 --> 00:04:00.106
Doctors
and Secret Service agents

00:04:00.106 --> 00:04:01.407
were aghast at the spectacle.

00:04:01.407 --> 00:04:03.509
So what prompted
this reckless jaunt

00:04:03.509 --> 00:04:04.743
that put people in harm's way?

00:04:04.743 --> 00:04:06.045
According to
"The Washington Post,"

00:04:06.045 --> 00:04:08.348
Trump told advisers on Sunday
he was getting bored

00:04:08.348 --> 00:04:09.882
being in the hospital
and was tiring

00:04:09.882 --> 00:04:12.384
of watching coverage
of his hospitalization.

00:04:12.384 --> 00:04:14.854
Oh, you were bored?
Well, that must be nice.

00:04:14.854 --> 00:04:16.889
Meanwhile, the rest of us
stop, drop and roll

00:04:16.889 --> 00:04:19.158
every time a CNN alert
pops up on our phones.

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:22.295
Bored? You hospital suite
is basically a luxury apartment.

00:04:22.295 --> 00:04:24.530
I hate to point this out,
but that room

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:26.532
and your top of the line
medical care probably cost

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:28.867
more than the $750
you paid in taxes.

00:04:28.867 --> 00:04:31.670
You know what $750 normally
gets you in a hospital?

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:35.607
Three Tylenol --
three regular-strength Tylenol.

00:04:35.607 --> 00:04:37.142
So not only are we paying

00:04:37.142 --> 00:04:38.611
for your top-of-the-line
medical care,

00:04:38.611 --> 00:04:39.812
but you're also missing work.

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:42.615
I mean, did you even sign
that blank piece of paper

00:04:42.615 --> 00:04:43.850
like we asked you?

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:45.284
Oh, you did. Okay.

00:04:45.284 --> 00:04:47.420
That's my bad. That's my bad.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:49.155
Thank you.
We needed that right away.

00:04:49.155 --> 00:04:51.190
I mean, these people don't
even know how to fake work.

00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:53.759
We should put out a photo
showing he's hard at work.

00:04:53.759 --> 00:04:55.094
Good idea. What would that be?

00:04:55.094 --> 00:04:57.195
[ Groans ] I don't know.

00:04:57.195 --> 00:04:59.164
This is crazy, but maybe signing
a blank piece of paper?

00:04:59.164 --> 00:05:00.600
Does a president do that?

00:05:00.600 --> 00:05:02.334
President, he looks like
he should have a booth

00:05:02.334 --> 00:05:03.769
at Comic-Con.

00:05:03.769 --> 00:05:05.204
By the way, while all this
is happening,

00:05:05.204 --> 00:05:07.673
there's still a presidential
election less than a month away.

00:05:07.673 --> 00:05:08.941
In fact, I can't believe
this is the case,

00:05:08.941 --> 00:05:10.809
but as we speak,
the president the entirety

00:05:10.809 --> 00:05:12.111
of the institutional
Republican Party,

00:05:12.111 --> 00:05:14.113
and its vast legal apparatus
are desperately trying

00:05:14.113 --> 00:05:16.516
to disrupt and undermine
an election that's happening

00:05:16.516 --> 00:05:18.484
in less than 30 days,
and it's like the, what,

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:20.852
eighth biggest story in the news
right now?

00:05:20.852 --> 00:05:22.355
A prehistoric sea monster

00:05:22.355 --> 00:05:24.490
could awaken from
a thousand-year slumber

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:25.891
and rampage through Manhattan.

00:05:25.891 --> 00:05:29.429
It would be relegated to page 12
of the real-estate section.

00:05:29.429 --> 00:05:32.164
Absolutely insane, shocking,

00:05:32.164 --> 00:05:34.567
eye-popping quotes show up
in the news all the time now.

00:05:34.567 --> 00:05:36.769
And we just flip past them
like we're browsing through

00:05:36.769 --> 00:05:38.103
paint swatches at Home Depot.

00:05:38.103 --> 00:05:39.905
For example, the A.P. reported
that Trump and the GOP

00:05:39.905 --> 00:05:41.840
are attacking voting rules
across the country.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:44.643
And buried in that story was
this quote from a GOP lawyer

00:05:44.643 --> 00:05:48.080
who led George Bush's legal team
in the 2000 Florida recount.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:49.948
"It's clearly based
on an overall strategy

00:05:49.948 --> 00:05:52.251
to disrupt the election
as much as possible."

00:05:52.251 --> 00:05:53.585
"You're really seeing
a broad-based,

00:05:53.585 --> 00:05:55.320
generalized strategy
to suppress the vote

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:56.288
by the Republican Party."

00:05:56.288 --> 00:05:58.290
Okay. Well, that sucks.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:59.525
Too bad, I guess.

00:05:59.525 --> 00:06:01.093
It'd be great to spend
some more time on that.

00:06:01.093 --> 00:06:03.495
But CNN just reported
that our infectious president

00:06:03.495 --> 00:06:06.031
is at the US Mint
licking the nickels.

00:06:06.031 --> 00:06:07.867
[ As Trump ] I want them to
have that nice corona sheen.

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:09.201
[ Normal voice ] But there's
a common thread here

00:06:09.201 --> 00:06:11.137
between Trump's denial of
reality when it comes to COVID

00:06:11.137 --> 00:06:13.539
and his denial of reality
when it comes to voting.

00:06:13.539 --> 00:06:16.709
The GOP's attempt to disrupt the
election is based on the lie

00:06:16.709 --> 00:06:18.344
that mail voting leads to fraud.

00:06:18.344 --> 00:06:19.779
At last week's
presidential debate,

00:06:19.779 --> 00:06:22.414
Trump said ballots were being
dumped in creeks and rivers

00:06:22.414 --> 00:06:24.883
despite the fact that obviously
no such thing has happened.

00:06:24.883 --> 00:06:26.986
And on Thursday,
White House Press Secretary

00:06:26.986 --> 00:06:30.089
Kayleigh McEnany, who today
also tested positive,

00:06:30.089 --> 00:06:32.458
held a maskless indoor
press briefing

00:06:32.458 --> 00:06:35.127
where she tried to defend the
comment about rivers in a clip

00:06:35.127 --> 00:06:37.129
that sadly was overshadowed
by the rest of the news

00:06:37.129 --> 00:06:40.199
because it's one of my favorite
exchanges from the Trump era.

00:06:50.509 --> 00:06:51.777
-The local authorities.

00:06:51.777 --> 00:06:53.379
It was a ditch in Wisconsin
that they were found in.

00:06:53.379 --> 00:06:55.514
I can get the article
to your inbox if you like.

00:06:55.514 --> 00:06:57.716
And you're missing the forest
for the trees here.

00:06:57.716 --> 00:06:59.752
The point is --

00:07:09.128 --> 00:07:10.329
-There used to be curiosity.

00:07:10.329 --> 00:07:11.397
In fact,
"The Washington Post"...

00:07:11.397 --> 00:07:13.899
Said mail-in voting is not ready

00:07:13.899 --> 00:07:15.667
to scale up in the middle
of the pandemic.

00:07:15.667 --> 00:07:17.335
Now there's no journalistic
curiosity

00:07:17.335 --> 00:07:18.538
when we're finding --

00:07:18.538 --> 00:07:22.408
100,000 ballots were sent out
in Brooklyn.

00:07:22.408 --> 00:07:25.745
They were inaccurate ballots,
and then 100,000 more --

00:07:25.745 --> 00:07:29.348
Shameful filibustering and lack
of journalistic curiosity.

00:07:29.348 --> 00:07:30.816
Yes? Yes?

00:07:30.816 --> 00:07:33.319
-Incredible. The president
and his aides are so deranged

00:07:33.319 --> 00:07:36.588
that for reporters to just
inquire about basic facts

00:07:36.588 --> 00:07:37.890
sounds like an argument between

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.492
Lewis and Clark
if they were lost.

00:07:39.492 --> 00:07:41.260
"Where's the river, Lewis?"
"I'm looking."

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:44.229
"Is there a river or not?"
"Clark, it's very hard

00:07:44.229 --> 00:07:46.432
to do this with you
badgering me.

00:07:46.432 --> 00:07:48.300
Oh! There it is. No. No.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:49.535
Ohh. That's a ditch."

00:07:49.535 --> 00:07:50.903
"Lewis!"

00:07:50.903 --> 00:07:53.105
Which brings us...
That's how they talked.

00:07:53.105 --> 00:07:54.640
...brings us to the common
throughline

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:57.309
from the mail ballot story
to the White House COVID cluster

00:07:57.309 --> 00:08:00.112
which now includes several cases
that can apparently

00:08:00.112 --> 00:08:01.847
be traced back to
the Rose Garden ceremony

00:08:01.847 --> 00:08:03.849
announcing the nomination
of Amy Coney Barrett

00:08:03.849 --> 00:08:06.118
to the Supreme Court,
an event in which attendees

00:08:06.118 --> 00:08:08.621
are seen hugging and talking
in close proximity

00:08:08.621 --> 00:08:10.256
and at which there were even
indoor events

00:08:10.256 --> 00:08:12.258
without masks
or social distancing.

00:08:12.258 --> 00:08:14.426
If there was an epidemic
of bear attacks,

00:08:14.426 --> 00:08:16.395
these people would be running
around in the woods

00:08:16.395 --> 00:08:18.764
wearing scarves
made of sausage links.

00:08:18.764 --> 00:08:20.966
The reason they were rushing
to have this super spreader gala

00:08:20.966 --> 00:08:22.300
in the first place
was so they could get

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:24.236
their conservative
super majority on the court

00:08:24.236 --> 00:08:26.471
in time for the election Trump
is trying to undermine,

00:08:26.471 --> 00:08:28.840
and for a Supreme Court case
in November

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:30.776
in which Trump is trying
to destroy Obamacare

00:08:30.776 --> 00:08:33.745
and rip healthcare away
from millions amid a pandemic

00:08:33.745 --> 00:08:36.282
including those with
pre-existing conditions,

00:08:36.282 --> 00:08:37.850
among them the 7 million
Americans

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.585
who have now been infected
with COVID,

00:08:39.585 --> 00:08:42.888
and in doing so, they ended up
getting sick themselves.

00:08:42.888 --> 00:08:45.057
If this were one of Aesop's
fables, even Aesop

00:08:45.057 --> 00:08:47.326
would be like, "Do I really need
to spell it out to you guys?"

00:08:47.326 --> 00:08:49.194
They're all so brazen,
and their lack of empathy --

00:08:49.194 --> 00:08:50.963
again, I can't believe
I have to explain this --

00:08:50.963 --> 00:08:53.065
but it's not just about you.

00:08:53.065 --> 00:08:56.235
Even if you don't care about
your own health,

00:08:56.235 --> 00:08:58.571
you can get other people sick.

00:08:58.571 --> 00:09:01.173
For example,
Wisconsin Senator Ron Johnson

00:09:01.173 --> 00:09:02.508
took a COVID test on Friday.

00:09:02.508 --> 00:09:04.509
And then while he was waiting
for his results,

00:09:04.509 --> 00:09:06.279
went to a political event
anyway.

00:09:06.279 --> 00:09:08.280
-Senator Ron Johnson
also announcing

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:10.416
he has tested positive
for coronavirus.

00:09:10.416 --> 00:09:13.152
He says he learned he was
positive after attending

00:09:13.152 --> 00:09:15.321
a fundraiser last night.

00:09:15.321 --> 00:09:19.257
Senator Ron Johnson says he took
a COVID test Friday in Oshkosh

00:09:19.257 --> 00:09:21.860
as he was headed
to an Ozaukee County event.

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:24.897
The senator says he was socially
distant at the fundraiser

00:09:24.897 --> 00:09:27.500
and had a mask on
except when he was speaking.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:30.569
-What do you mean you had a mask
on except when speaking?

00:09:30.569 --> 00:09:33.438
You were addressing a crowd
indoors.

00:09:33.438 --> 00:09:35.941
That's like only taking
the safety off the gun

00:09:35.941 --> 00:09:37.977
when it's your turn
on the trampoline.

00:09:37.977 --> 00:09:39.845
You should have been
self-isolating, but instead,

00:09:39.845 --> 00:09:41.346
you were at an Oktoberfest
dinner?

00:09:41.346 --> 00:09:44.249
You're the "wurst"! [worst]
Danke.

00:09:44.249 --> 00:09:46.551
Danke schoen.

00:09:46.551 --> 00:09:49.055
Shoemaker, I give that joke
a "Nein!" [nine] out of ten.

00:09:49.055 --> 00:09:53.492
[ Laughter ]

00:09:53.492 --> 00:09:54.927
The attempt to undermine
the election,

00:09:54.927 --> 00:09:56.662
the Rose Garden
super spreader gala,

00:09:56.662 --> 00:09:58.130
the constant lying about
everything,

00:09:58.130 --> 00:09:59.598
in a way, it's all one story.

00:09:59.598 --> 00:10:02.267
That's maybe the most
bewilderling -- bewildering

00:10:02.267 --> 00:10:04.170
fact of life in the Trump era.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.472
Every day there's a shocking
new thing you could never have

00:10:06.472 --> 00:10:09.140
imagined in your wildest dreams.
And yet, at the same time,

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:12.244
every Trump story is basically
the same Trump story.

00:10:12.244 --> 00:10:15.348
We can't believe a word
the president or his aides say.

00:10:15.348 --> 00:10:17.315
We have no idea what to believe.

00:10:17.315 --> 00:10:20.352
It's the Sharpie map
